{"category": "Achievements", "line_index": 7, "text": "찾았다!"}
{"category": "Achievements", "line_index": 8, "text": "달콤한 로맨스"}
{"category": "Achievements", "line_index": 9, "text": "조건 달성 완료."}
{"category": "Achievements", "line_index": 10, "text": "가속!"}
{"category": "Achievements", "line_index": 11, "text": "머리 톡톡!"}
